    {
      "itemId": "cherubin",
      "name": "Cherubin",
      "pointsCost": 5,
      "costNote": "model",
      "category": null,
      "effects": [
        "Units eligible to be equipped with Cherubin will state how many the unit can be equipped with. Each time a unit uses the Shoot Action, you can declare that the unit is using a Cherubin as part of that Action. When you do so, select 1 model in the unit making a Ranged attack. That model increases the Attacks characteristic of the Ranged weapon they are using by 2. Once those attacks are completed, remove the Cherubin model from the battlefield. A unit can use any number of Cherubin you choose as part of the Shoot Action, but models in the unit can only benefit from 1 Cherubin ability at a time. In other words, 2 Cherubin cannot be used on 1 model to increase that model's Ranged attacks characteristic by 4."
      ],
      "effectsHtml": "<p>Units eligible to be equipped with Cherubin will state how many the unit can be equipped with. Each time a unit uses the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"shoot\" data-type=\"action\">Shoot</span> Action, you can declare that the unit is using a Cherubin as part of that Action. When you do so, select 1 model in the unit making a Ranged attack. That model increases the Attacks characteristic of the Ranged weapon they are using by 2. Once those attacks are completed, remove the Cherubin model from the battlefield. A unit can use any number of Cherubin you choose as part of the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"shoot\" data-type=\"action\">Shoot</span> Action, but models in the unit can only benefit from 1 Cherubin ability at a time. In other words, 2 Cherubin cannot be used on 1 model to increase that model's Ranged attacks characteristic by 4.</p>",
