    {
      "itemId": "paragon-warsuit",
      "name": "Paragon Warsuit",
      "pointsCost": 25,
      "costNote": null,
      "category": null,
      "effects": [
        "Models equipped with a Paragon Warsuit:",
        "Gain the Walker keyword",
        "Increase their Movement characteristic to 8\"",
        "Increase their Strength characteristic by 3",
        "Increase their Toughness characteristic by 3",
        "Increase their Wounds characteristic by 3",
        "Increase their Armour Save characteristic to 2+",
        "Gain the Invulnerable Save 5+ ability",
        "Models equipped with a Paragon Warsuit do not select Ranged and Melee weapon options detailed under their unit's Wargear Options, and must make selections as detailed below.",
        "Each model must be equipped with 1 of the following Primary Ranged Weapons:",
        "Heavy Bolter",
        "Heavy Flamer",
        "Multi-melta",
        "Each model must be equipped with 1 of the following Secondary Ranged Weapons:",
        "1x Twin-linked Storm Bolter",
        "1x Twin-linked Grenade Launcher",
        "1x Twin-linked Flamer",
        "1x Twin-linked Meltagun",
        "Each model must be equipped with 1 of the following Primary Melee Weapons:",
        "Paragon War Blade",
        "Paragon War Mace",
        "Paragon War Spear",
        "Any model can replace its Bolt Pistol with 1 of the following:",
        "Hand Flamer",
        "Melta Pistol",
        "Each model can be equipped with any of the following:",
        "Frag Grenades",
        "Krak Grenades",
        "Any eligible weapon equipped by a Leader model equipped with a Paragon Warsuit can be upgraded to a Relic Weapon.",
        "Leader models equipped with a Paragon Warsuit can only Lead units that are also equipped with Paragon Warsuits."
      ],
      "effectsHtml": "<p>Models equipped with a <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"paragon-warsuit\">Paragon Warsuit</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gain the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"walker\" data-type=\"keyword\">Walker</span> keyword</li>\n<li>Increase their Movement characteristic to 8\"</li>\n<li>Increase their Strength characteristic by 3</li>\n<li>Increase their Toughness characteristic by 3</li>\n<li>Increase their Wounds characteristic by 3</li>\n<li>Increase their Armour Save characteristic to 2+</li>\n<li>Gain the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"invulnerable-save-5\" data-type=\"keyword\">Invulnerable Save 5+</span> ability</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Models equipped with a <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"paragon-warsuit\">Paragon Warsuit</span> do not select Ranged and Melee weapon options detailed under their unit's Wargear Options, and must make selections as detailed below.</p>\n<p>Each model must be equipped with 1 of the following Primary Ranged Weapons:</p>\n<p>Heavy Bolter</p>\n<p>Heavy Flamer</p>\n<p>Multi-melta</p>\n<p>Each model must be equipped with 1 of the following Secondary Ranged Weapons:</p>\n<p>1x <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"twin-linked\">Twin-linked</span> <span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"storm-bolter\">Storm Bolter</span></p>\n<p>1x <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"twin-linked\">Twin-linked</span> <span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"grenade-launcher\">Grenade Launcher</span></p>\n<p>1x <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"twin-linked\">Twin-linked</span> <span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"flamer\">Flamer</span></p>\n<p>1x <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"twin-linked\">Twin-linked</span> <span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"meltagun\">Meltagun</span></p>\n<p>Each model must be equipped with 1 of the following Primary Melee Weapons:</p>\n<p>Paragon War Blade</p>\n<p>Paragon War Mace</p>\n<p>Paragon War Spear</p>\n<p>Any model can replace its <span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"bolt-pistol\">Bolt Pistol</span> with 1 of the following:</p>\n<p>Hand Flamer</p>\n<p>Melta Pistol</p>\n<p>Each model can be equipped with any of the following:</p>\n<p>Frag Grenades</p>\n<p>Krak Grenades</p>\n<p>Any eligible weapon equipped by a <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"leader\" data-type=\"keyword\">Leader</span> model equipped with a <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"paragon-warsuit\">Paragon Warsuit</span> can be upgraded to a <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"relic-weapon\">Relic Weapon</span>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"leader\" data-type=\"keyword\">Leader</span> models equipped with a <span class=\"wargear-ref\" data-wargear=\"paragon-warsuit\">Paragon Warsuit</span> can only Lead units that are also equipped with Paragon Warsuits.</p>",
